        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that queries metric data filtered by resource labels or dimensions using a concrete external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the Google Cloud Monitoring API for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that allows querying metric data. </thinking>\n",
