      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that retrieves aggregated statistics for a metric over a time window using a concrete external provider. I will use the AWS CloudWatch service for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that offers metric aggregation capabilities. The script will use the Boto3 library to interact with AWS CloudWatch. </thinking>\n",
